ack adventure to Shakespeare\\'s Globe Theatre. His company also runs programmes that encourage pupils to learn coding skills.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003C!-- \/wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\n\u003C!-- wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EBefore VR, his company has worked on video installations, healthcare mobile apps, treadmill fitness software and interactive 3D kiosks. Clients including Bank of America, Ford Motor Company and Samsung USA.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003C!-- \/wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\n\u003C!-- wp:paragraph --\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EYinch founded playko after working as lead developer on console games and multimedia titles. He graduated with a Masters in Engineering from Imperial College, London.\u003C\/p\u003E\n\u003C!-- \/wp:paragraph --\u003E","post_title":"Yinch Yeap","post_excerpt":"","post_status":"publish","comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","post_password":"","post_name":"yinch-yeap","to_ping":"","pinged":"","post_modified":"2024-01-26 16:56:23","post_modified_gmt":"2024-01-26 16:56:23","post_content_filtered":"","post_parent":0,"guid":"https:\/\/webxr.events\/?post_type=profile&#038;p=1140","menu_order":0,"post_type":"profile","post_mime_type":"","comment_count":"0","filter":"raw"},"post_type":"profile","meta":{"_edit_lock":["1706288184:1"],"_thumbnail_id":["1143"],"_edit_last":["1"],"timezone":["-7| PDT"],"_yoast_wpseo_content_score":["90"],"_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes":["1"],"first_name":["Yinch"],"email":["yinch@playko.com"],"profile_title":["CEO\/CTO"],"company":["playko"],"website":["https:\/\/www.playko.com"],"twitter":["https:\/\/twitter.com\/yinch"],"linkedin":["https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/in\/yinchyeap\/"],"discord":["yinch#4444"],"inline_featured_image":["0"],"duration":["179"],"utc_start":["0"],"session_type":["panel"],"suppress_profile_page":["0"],"PhD":["0"],"use_aframe":["0"],"registration_pending":["0"],"invitation_sent":["0"],"calendar_sent":["0"],"calendar_confirmed":["0"],"signed_release":["0"],"request_profile_update